Package: oovmstat
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: VIRTUAL MEMORY
 Reports virtual memory statistics, page faults, context switches, and IO waits.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
